<title>JAPAN: Taiyo Co to issue 7 bln yen CB.</title>
<headline>Taiyo Co to issue 7 bln yen CB.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Taiyo Co Ltd</p>
<p> LEAD MGR - Nikko Securities Co Ltd</p>
<p> TRUSTEE - Kagoshima Bank Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE convertible     ISSUE NO   2	  AMT   7 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISS PRICE	     MATURITY 31.Aug.04</p>
<p> CONV PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p> CONV FROM 1.Oct.97   CONV TO 30.Aug.04</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	   PAY DATE 8.Aug.97   INT PAY end Feb/Aug</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE 24.Jul-7.Aug</p>
<p> LAST JCR   BBB+	LAST JBRI  BBB+     LAST NIS</p>
<p>The coupon and conversion price will be decided on July 23.</p>
</text>
